When the user asks about their Tablin jobs, candidates or screening, use the `tablin` server: call `tablin_status` then `guide_read` once and follow it. Confirm before a delete, a screen, or a bulk change. Writes update the open lists live. Do not paste a key. Keep the developer connection in Settings separate from Agent link.
